{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e81b5b27e3fa1f7f","name":"Searching the Debris Field","source":{"id":"source:reference-e81b5b27e3fa1f7f","title":"Searching the Debris Field","revision":21244,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:25:25Z","sha256":"6c0cff220d89cab3711244c86b3ad6c223082dcf591de126cac98f32ef8c7b8f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21244","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Searching%20the%20Debris%20Field&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e81b5b27e3fa1f7f","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},", the heroes are aboard their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," investigating a debris field left behind after a major space battle. They are searching for something- perhaps survivors of the clash or rare cargo that was aboard one of the ships- but to find it, they must navigate through the debris field without destroying their own vessel.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Searching the Debris Field Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Complexity:"]}," 2 (8 Successes before 3 Failures)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested Primary Skills for this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," (DC 23):"]}," The heroes can attempt to boost power to their sensors, increasing the chance that they will find what they are hunting."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," (DC 23):"]}," The heroes can try to use visual scanning out the cockpit windows or gun turrets to spot anything the sensors miss."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," (DC 23):"]}," The ship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Copilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Copilot","referenceId":"reference:49f5b0e488cfa66c"}," can attempt to plot a safe grid pattern to search the debris field without taking too much damage."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," (DC 18):"]}," The ",{"tag":"a","children":["System Operator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/System_Operator","referenceId":"reference:75f56e8f22b64ca4"}," can try to calibrate the sensors to more closely match the profile of the object that the heroes are looking for."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Challenge Effects"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Challenge Effects"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Challenge_Effects"}," for this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Degrees of Failure"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Degrees_of_Failure","referenceId":"reference:8d28a4bee6e70b14"},":"]}," For each Failure earned, the heroes' ship collides with a chunk of space debris that is of Colossal size, taking 8d6+10 points of damage."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Extreme Success"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Extreme_Success","referenceId":"reference:bb5a69f0ddc5d175"},":"]}," A hero who succeeds on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," by 10 or more earns two Successes instead of one."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Success and Failure"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Success:"]}," The heroes find the object they seek and load it safely onto their ship.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Failure:"]}," In addition to any damage sustained from collisions with debris, the heroes fail to locate the object in time. It might have been salvaged by rivals or destroyed in a collision.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
